{
  "name": "Price Drop Sniper \u2014 Siva",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "38e57a7b-9cbe-481a-86b6-b3cd8cba46a5",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Price Drop Sniper \u2014 setup\n1. Create the Google Sheet (tabs: Watchlist, Price Log, Alerts, Execution Log, Errors) \u2014 see SETUP.md.\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets, Google Gemini API, Telegram.\n3. Paste your Sheet ID where marked YOUR_*. Add products to the Watchlist tab.\n4. Test with Manual Trigger first. Only then activate the schedule.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "60e11389-4705-4249-9936-bbc80c5bea53",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "content": "## Hard rules (do not remove)\n- This workflow NEVER buys anything. It only alerts Siva on Telegram.\n- A purchase happens only if Siva buys it himself after the alert.\n- Prices come only from the fetched page or the sheet \u2014 never invented.\n- If a price cannot be parsed, the item is logged as 'price not found', never guessed.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2d1dd1d0-a4e5-4829-8c6f-ebd0282bac53",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Memory",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Memory / learning\nThe Price Log sheet is the memory layer: every price check is logged, so\nbaselines and drop history survive across runs. Baselines in the Watchlist\ntab are updated only from real fetched prices, never from AI estimates.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8f42b658-63a8-48cf-806d-44d463a39430",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "820eabe9-a8f7-49c6-be46-9ba25dc8810e",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Runs every 2 hours."
    },
    {
      "id": "5153484c-e6f3-4a6f-9b03-d7d559d440d3",
      "name": "Read Watchlist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
        "operation": "read",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "sheetName": "Watchlist"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "0a4a192c-dc81-4dad-aa03-40b1350adf32",
      "name": "Split In Batches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        460,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "One product at a time."
    },
    {
      "id": "0ae96cbc-e61b-478d-89dc-c7cb85abbf31",
      "name": "Fetch Product Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "url": "={{ $json.URL || $json.Url || $json.url }}"
      },
      "notes": "Fetches the product/listing page. Facebook Marketplace and eBay often block scraping \u2014 a failed fetch is logged, not faked.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "88b791e2-7eac-4bd7-9afe-f48ee536778a",
      "name": "Parse Price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract a price from the fetched page. Tries JSON-LD price, then common\n// price patterns. If nothing is found, price stays null \u2014 never invented.\nconst item = $('Split In Batches').first().json;\nconst raw = typeof $input.first().json.data === 'string' ? $input.first().json.data : JSON.stringify($input.first().json);\nlet price = null;\nconst ld = raw.match(/\"price\"\\s*:\\s*\"?([0-9][0-9,]*\\.?[0-9]*)\"?/);\nif (ld) price = parseFloat(ld[1].replace(/,/g, ''));\nif (price === null) {\n  const m = raw.match(/(?:Rs\\.?|INR|\\$|\u00a3|\u20ac)\\s*([0-9][0-9,]*(?:\\.[0-9]{2})?)/);\n  if (m) price = parseFloat(m[1].replace(/,/g, ''));\n}\nconst baseline = parseFloat(item['Baseline Price'] || item.baselinePrice || 0) || 0;\nconst target = parseFloat(item['Target Price'] || item.targetPrice || 0) || 0;\nconst dropPct = (price !== null && baseline > 0) ? ((baseline - price) / baseline) * 100 : 0;\nreturn [{ json: { product: item.Product || item.product || '',\n  url: item.URL || item.Url || item.url || '', source: item.Source || item.source || '',\n  baseline, target, price, dropPct,\n  priceFound: price !== null, checkedAt: new Date().toISOString() } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ab5d9df5-b51d-4933-96ba-94acf18c03e0",
      "name": "Price Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "found-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.priceFound }}",
              "operator": {
                "name": "filter.operator.boolean.true",
                "operation": "true",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "39030c85-80e6-40c0-98b4-1468a7b52fc7",
      "name": "Log Price Not Found",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
        "operation": "append",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "sheetName": "Price Log",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "Product"
          ],
          "schema": [],
          "value": {
            "Product": "={{ $json.product }}",
            "Source": "={{ $json.source }}",
            "URL": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "Price": "not found \u2014 page may block scraping",
            "Baseline Price": "={{ $json.baseline }}",
            "Checked At": "={{ $json.checkedAt }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "14a4d5a8-56ac-47da-afe5-b17f7cf02d53",
      "name": "Price Drop?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "drop-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.dropPct >= 10 }}",
              "operator": {
                "name": "filter.operator.boolean.true",
                "operation": "true",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "rightValue": true
            },
            {
              "id": "target-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.target > 0 && $json.price <= $json.target }}",
              "operator": {
                "name": "filter.operator.boolean.true",
                "operation": "true",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "TRUE when the price fell 10%+ vs baseline OR hit the target price."
    },
    {
      "id": "a50ed48c-3fce-473d-b70f-fc141f57cfe1",
      "name": "Log No Drop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
        "operation": "append",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "sheetName": "Price Log",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "Product"
          ],
          "schema": [],
          "value": {
            "Product": "={{ $json.product }}",
            "Source": "={{ $json.source }}",
            "URL": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "Price": "={{ $json.price }}",
            "Baseline Price": "={{ $json.baseline }}",
            "Checked At": "={{ $json.checkedAt }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "c1285bb8-1f7c-414c-a068-846589b6b35a",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.0-flash",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Free-tier Gemini model. Connect your Google Gemini API credential here."
    },
    {
      "id": "fc62d94e-2101-48b6-a8ed-23cad2123899",
      "name": "Check Resale Value",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        1780,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are Siva's resale analyst. Given a product, its current price, its baseline price and its source, estimate whether it is worth buying to resell in India. Use only the facts provided \u2014 never invent a market price. State your uncertainty clearly. Consider typical resale platforms (OLX, eBay, Facebook Marketplace) and that fees and shipping eat margin. Be conservative: if you are unsure, say so."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Product: {{ $json.product }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\nCurrent price: {{ $json.price }} (baseline was {{ $json.baseline }}, drop {{ $json.dropPct }}%)\nListing: {{ $json.url }}\nReply with ONLY this JSON, no other text: {\"resaleEstimate\": 0, \"profitEstimate\": 0, \"confidence\": 0.0, \"reason\": \"...\", \"worthIt\": true or false}. resaleEstimate and profitEstimate are rough numbers in the same currency as the price. If you cannot estimate honestly, set worthIt to false and say why."
      },
      "notes": "AI resale check. Estimates are rough \u2014 Siva verifies before any purchase."
    },
    {
      "id": "746c0e75-af0e-45fc-a886-975f744564d1",
      "name": "Parse Resale Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the resale JSON; on failure, treat as not worth it \u2014 never alert on a guess.\nconst raw = $input.first().json.output || $input.first().json.text || '';\nconst prev = $('Price Drop?').first().json;\nlet p = {};\ntry { p = JSON.parse(raw); } catch (e) {\n  const m = String(raw).match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  try { p = m ? JSON.parse(m[0]) : {}; } catch (e2) { p = {}; }\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ...prev, resaleEstimate: p.resaleEstimate || 0,\n  profitEstimate: p.profitEstimate || 0,\n  confidence: typeof p.confidence === 'number' ? p.confidence : 0,\n  reason: p.reason || 'Could not parse resale check',\n  worthIt: p.worthIt === true } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c105f8a2-fe96-4200-9714-b0342e535db0",
      "name": "Worth It?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2220,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "worth-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.worthIt }}",
              "operator": {
                "name": "filter.operator.boolean.true",
                "operation": "true",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "rightValue": true
            },
            {
              "id": "profit-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.profitEstimate >= 500 }}",
              "operator": {
                "name": "filter.operator.boolean.true",
                "operation": "true",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Alerts only when the AI says worth it AND estimated profit is at least 500 (same currency)."
    },
    {
      "id": "b78faf9d-b79c-4c5b-83e4-984d2e96e621",
      "name": "Log Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2440,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
        "operation": "append",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "sheetName": "Alerts",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "Product"
          ],
          "schema": [],
          "value": {
            "Product": "={{ $json.product }}",
            "Source": "={{ $json.source }}",
            "URL": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "Price": "={{ $json.price }}",
            "Baseline Price": "={{ $json.baseline }}",
            "Drop %": "={{ $json.dropPct }}",
            "Resale Estimate": "={{ $json.resaleEstimate }}",
            "Profit Estimate": "={{ $json.profitEstimate }}",
            "Alerted At": "={{ $json.checkedAt }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "59c4c852-0948-4108-bbb9-c72d78749532",
      "name": "Telegram Price Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2660,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=Price drop sniper found a deal\n\n{{ $json.product }} ({{ $json.source }})\nPrice now: {{ $json.price }} (was {{ $json.baseline }}, down {{ $json.dropPct }}%)\nResale estimate: {{ $json.resaleEstimate }} \u2014 profit estimate: {{ $json.profitEstimate }}\n{{ $json.reason }}\n\n{{ $json.url }}\n\nThis is an alert only \u2014 nothing was bought. Check the listing yourself before buying.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "notes": "HUMAN APPROVAL: no purchase node exists in this workflow. Siva buys manually if he agrees.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "688b29aa-24d9-45db-a212-707fc397c3a8",
      "name": "Log Execution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2880,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
        "operation": "append",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "sheetName": "Execution Log",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "At"
          ],
          "schema": [],
          "value": {
            "At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "Workflow": "Price Drop Sniper \u2014 Siva",
            "Status": "={{ $json.status || 'completed' }}",
            "Detail": "= $('Parse Price').first().json.product"
          }
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "76c57a16-7c72-42ef-8966-2cef29999c0b",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "dafaee50-c480-4d0d-b773-56706d62bb69",
      "name": "Log Error to Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
